  "body": "### What are you trying to do\n\nIt would be convenient to have a button similar to the \"report a bug\" button in Solidcraft to make feature requests and bug reports easier. \n\n### How you imagine it working\n\nIt should work exactly like it does in SolidCraft but with an additional focus on feature requests and not just bugs. Click the button and it prepares a template for a github issue. It would create and attach a screenshot and any relevant data. \n\n<img width=\"746\" height=\"264\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d5fae1b6-0a7e-4fa5-859d-95f1f6cd4bd1\" />",
